# Regenerable (see ../README.md › Soundtrack): tools/foley.py + bin/vh sfx lib → sfx/; bin/vh music → music.wav;
# bin/vh mix → mix.wav, stems/, mix.log; bin/vh qa → qa*.txt*. The Gemini narration takes are not reproducible, so
# their master is the committed voiceover.<lang>.flac: voiceover.<lang>.wav is decoded from it and the per-line cuts in
# vo/ are start–end slices of it (timeline.<lang>.json). Rebuild everything with tools/build_audio.sh.
*.wav
sfx/
vo/
stems/
mix.log
qa*.txt
